      "technicalView": "RSI at 62.4 with MACD histogram positive; momentum leaned constructive.",
      "fundamentalView": "Sector valuation multiple at 28.5x P/E with 8.4% revenue trajectory.",
      "newsView": "Regulatory/catalyst sentiment scored cautious (-0.52), necessitating risk adjustment.",
      "historicalContext": "Analog engine confirmed 6 matching historical regime windows.",
